  "description": "Buy Performers...Not Loping Giants",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> StockTok</strong></em>. We have talked about Affirm before, one of my favorite companies and a trade we have conducted before in November 2024, where it ran over 88% since the post. It appears ready for a 2<sup>nd</sup> run! <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZTjs8fBsL/\">You can watch the original explanation on Affirm here.</a> This is kind of a Frankenstein post…the video above discusses why I will NOT participate in the Bitcoin euphoria.<strong> Long story short: Bitcoin provides <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/bitcoins-diminishing-returns-even?r=4z8lgl\">diminishing returns, elaborated here</a>, yet Affirm offers massive long term percent potential. </strong></p><p>We will be doing Mid-Week Movers tomorrow 12 June, a <em><strong>🔒 subscriber-only stock review🔒</strong></em>. We have 20 stocks, and as of now, I have 8 in the “Top Spots” that I am sorting through to determine who is the winner. It will be a great episode!</p><p>Finally, thanks for everyone that has joined. We have risen to the <strong>#4 FASTEST RISING </strong>Finance page here on Substack! 🎉</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9qAQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1564ddd7-cb51-449a-be1a-016ae846c16e_567x397.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9qAQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1564ddd7-cb51-449a-be1a-016ae846c16e_567x397.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9qAQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1564ddd7-cb51-449a-be1a-0